Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't the Demi's Lad sprays stopped yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be stuck\Nhere with this caravan forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chill out and have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll stop before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:01:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had enough, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am trying to think here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I butt this guy in the\Nhead and make a break for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, I can't do that.\NWhat am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a man of God, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.90,0:02:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She really needs dancing lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, back to reality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.85,0:02:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A simple look around will tell you we\Ndon't serve that kind of stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just asked for pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priest, what a peasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you guys are\Ntraveling with this caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right. Meryl and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash are here with me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you mean Vash the Stampede here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, yeah. Do you\Nknow him, too? Know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, little lady, he's\Nthe humanoid typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the hand, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't God's little\Ncreatures wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so darn smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to go down in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you doing don't you\Nrealize that the rest of my fear is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,riding on the outcome of this game\Nyou trying to get me thrown out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I give up! What? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for buying\Nall of these for me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my bacon, chess master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm good at chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My big brother used to make me\Nplay chess with him all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big brother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, that must be nice Any other siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but there's ten brothers and sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, you're the youngest,\Naren't you? Yeah, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how did you know that\Nsometimes the answers just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crash down from heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey aren't you the dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl from before I need\Nyour help, please don't let
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way did she go? Is she in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, mister You'll find\Nher hiding right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answered your question now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's only fair\Nyou answer mine there or not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That happened to be my can of pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never get between\Npeople and their pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you are the one who\Ndropped them, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you very much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard gunfire from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get all the guys together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let her escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, young lady, you're enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you expecting sextuplets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it lovely out today, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excruciatingly pleasant, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am really sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I always seem\Nto get into trouble with this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secondhand smoke is bad\Nfor the baby, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since Millie left to\Ngo buy whatever she's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is keeping\Nthat girl so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, is it true that\Nyou're Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for causing you any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be able\Nto lend a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I'm already in this so deep, will\Nyou at least tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from Moore! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius, stop shooting! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not late. More.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius and I have been\Nfriends since childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's the son of the owner of\Nthe big transportation company,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which passes through Demislat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, well, I'm just a simple dancing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why are they after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Fondrique. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Fondrique as\Nin the big city, Fondrique?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fondrique City's transportation needs\Nhave been left solely to my caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to my caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the security over there is so tight,\NI can't even get in without a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a very difficult situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're looking for your pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although he's actually\Nnot my real son. My so
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-called father just so\Nhappens to be the mayor of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fondrique And the caravan\Nneeds me because I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only pass they have\Nletting them into the city
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're actually after you and not\Nher That's still no reason to run away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you did Running away is not going\Nto solve anything But we do have a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ran away the day I discovered\Nthat my real father and the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man I thought was my father\Nwere doing something despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fondrique did use the caravan\Nto import cargo all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but their cargo wasn't always in boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bought you human rights. We own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me! Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They treat people like\Ntheir personal property.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way they're able\Nto get so rich. Horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, am I right in assuming that\Nshe's supposed to be the new cargo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the reason\Nwe had to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go on living like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help I need you to get\Nmy Julius back from me Without him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all trade will stop completely It'll be\Nthe end of this caravan We'll never survive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty million dollars. That's my\Nprice and it's not up for negotiation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty million?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is ludicrous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then find someone else to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's a deal then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay your price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I need to ask you\Nfor one other condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say thank you for helping\NMoore get away from those men. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where are you headed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someplace where we can be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not planning to go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The caravan people are pretty familiar\Nwith the land surrounding this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure they wouldn't\Ndare follow us through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it means the end of the caravan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you leave, they lose\Ntheir contract with the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The caravan goes under,\Nand everybody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any caravan that's\Nwilling to participate in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something like that should\Nnot be allowed to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Fondrique goes under, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are gonna die because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all so easy for you to say\Nbecause you're running from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that after you watch them\Ndie right in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you be able to make your\Nescape over the bodies of the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made up our minds to do\Nthis. It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the fewer sacrificed, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fewer sacrificed, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your freedom or the lives of\Nthe people in the caravan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's plain to see which is more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll choose for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do decide to leave,\Nsomebody is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still able to just run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you to show\Nme how determined you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think leaving's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want your thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you an important question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have yet to receive an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I still think that\Nwhat you're doing is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we still want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're doing it out of sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not our problem, and there's\Nnothing you can do to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going because it's what\Nmy big sister told me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When people need help, if\NI can, I have to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does everything I can't,\Nlike it's no big deal at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it gets up, you're going\Nto leave terrible scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must go back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to put\Nyourself in danger by coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, anything can happen\Nno matter where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they say journeys are social\Nscars that could affect your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't joke\Nabout a thing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're really funny, Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Millie Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what did that man ask\Nyou to do it's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nasty i hope hey why\Ndon't you say anything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a little hot, but I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he wasn't my real\Nfather, but I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I want him to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to live like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowing that my success depends\Non the suffering of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all so crazy. My\Nactions are making...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone suffer and now\Ni'm dragging you into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the priest was right after all\Nbut i'm fine really there they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are you going to stop\Nthis and say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then you talk\Nto me he wanted a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A kill? That's right.\NAnd you accepted? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a despicable\Noutlaw just like i thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well if that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to execute\Nrisk prevention procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind at least explaining\Nwhy you decided to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! My back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Mar! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that my father's order?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's the entire\Ncaravan's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Mr. Priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priest, I'm gonna pummel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord, what the hell am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I was infected by your nosiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I actually caught it from Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, looking for a fight,\Nthen you'd better expect no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, well if it isn't Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way was he hired by\Nmy father, please you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta help us, Vash, for\Nthe future of the caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you any idea what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your God is my witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you shot Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our pass is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it was never part of\Nthe agreement to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your boss hired me to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never mentioned their safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finished the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now leave the money and get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, are you suicidal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we made a big mistake here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should never have gone to\Nsomeone like him for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just like they said he's\Ngonna kill us all as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's really done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you even think of doing\Nsuch a horrible, evil thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shot them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shot them, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watched them both die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to settle what we\Nstarted back in May City? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a realistic performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty tough to kill when you're\Nshooting with rubber bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't fire those\Nso close. That stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a message from your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he's sorry for deceiving you,\Nand that even though it's no excuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he only did it because he was\Nprotecting you and the caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked me to tell you,\Nyou're now free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julius!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one that deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you forgot this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quickly, you've gotta\Ngo before they spot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on, we're gonna go\Non living without relying on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Millie, you take\Ncare of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thus, your name is being spread\Nacross the planet even as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is what they call karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a good girl, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, my friend, are just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean he's really\Nleft for good this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of life's journeys come with\Nmeetings and partings and reunions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got things to do,\Nso I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, whenever I look at you, I'm\Nreminded of everything I hate about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicholas D. Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be darned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All along, I thought there\Nhad to be a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there was another answer after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky in the middle of the\Nsky, the wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the day in\Nthe sky, as you can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:23:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.76,0:24:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deeper than darkness, Legato Blue\NSummers, a man fascinated by death,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only spoke quietly.

